    <headline>Gorkha, Aarughat: road fully blocked after the iron bridge at Soti was swept away</headline>
    <description>Update: Nepal Police notice 'Road blockages', to 8:00 AM on 2083-07-11 (Kartik 11, 28 Oct 2026): the iron motorable bridge at Soti linking Aarughat-2 and 3 was swept away by the Budhi Gandaki flood of Asoj 25 (11 Oct), and the road is still fully blocked. This is the only blockage on the nationwide list.</description>
    <instruction>Do not use this road; check with local police before travelling.</instruction>
